-- Natural floor (t2): hp is nat — ℕ clamped to [0, 2^53]. Repeated subtraction parks at 0; no underflow, no wraparound, the survivor keeps decrementing exactly. Twin of 134-natural-floor.bqn.
--! registry ../registries/134-natural-floor.reg
--! expect hp = 0 0 90 0

Alive , hp -= 55
Alive , hp -= 55
